(132, 12, NULL, 11, 'Foot care pedicure device', 'foot-care-pedicure-device', '<p><strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"84\">Personal Pedi Foot Care System</strong> – ঘরে বসেই পার্লার কোয়ালিটির পায়ের যত্ন! 🧼 ফাটা গোড়ালি ও খসখসে ত্বক মসৃণ করে, ব্যাটারি/USB চার্জেবল ডিজাইন, সহজে বহনযোগ্য ও পরিষ্কারযোগ্য। 🌿</p>', '<h3 data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"425\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Urbanist, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\">✅ <span data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"425\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">মূল বৈশিষ্ট্যসমূহ:</span></h3><p data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"543\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: \"Albert Sans\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118);\">🧼 <span data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"466\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">ডেড স্কিন ও ফাটা গোড়ালি দূর করে:</span><br data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"469\">শক্তিশালী রোটেটিং এক্সফোলিয়েটর যা গোড়ালির ফাটা ও খসখসে ত্বক মসৃণ করে তোলে।</p><p data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"648\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: \"Albert Sans\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118);\">💡 <span data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"576\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">পার্লার কোয়ালিটির কেয়ার:</span><br data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"579\">ব্যয়বহুল পেডিকিউর ছাড়াই ঘরে বসেই পায়ের যত্ন – সময় ও খরচ দুই-ই সাশ্রয়!</p><p data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"756\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: \"Albert Sans\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118);\">🔋 <span data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"686\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">ব্যাটারি অপারেটেড / চার্জেবল:</span><br data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"689\">যেকোনো সময়, যেকোনো জায়গায় সহজে ব্যবহারযোগ্য – ঝামেলামুক্ত অভিজ্ঞতা।</p><p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"864\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: \"Albert Sans\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118);\">👜 <span data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"794\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">কমফোর্টেবল ও পোর্টেবল ডিজাইন:</span><br data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"797\">হাতের মুঠোয় সহজে ধরা যায় – ছোট ব্যাগে বা ট্র্যাভেল ব্যাগে বহনযোগ্য।</p><p data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"982\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: \"Albert Sans\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118);\">🌿 <span data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"897\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">নরম ও প্রাকৃতিক অনুভূতি:</span><br data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"900\">চামড়ার প্রতি কোমল আচরণ করেও কার্যকরভাবে স্কিন রিমুভ করে – ত্বকে কোনো ক্ষতি করে না।</p><hr data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"987\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-top-width: initial; border-style: none none solid; border-right-width: initial; border-left-width: initial; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: currentcolor; opacity: 0.2; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); font-family: \"Albert Sans\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><h3 data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1013\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Urbanist, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; fo