 চাপ কমায়।</p></li><li data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"963\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\"><p data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"963\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\"><span data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"786\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">বহুমুখী ব্যবহার</span>: বই পড়া, লেখালেখি, পড়াশোনা, কম্পিউটার কাজ বা ল্যাপটপ ব্যবহার করার জন্য এই টেবিলটি উপযুক্ত। এটি একটি খুবই কার্যকরী টেবিল, বিশেষত যদি আপনি দীর্ঘ সময় ধরে বই পড়েন বা লেখালেখি করেন।</p></li><li data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1097\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\"><p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1097\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\"><span data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"987\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">মজবুত এবং টেকসই</span>: অ্যাডজাস্টেবল রিডিং টেবিল সাধারণত শক্তিশালী উপকরণ, যেমন কাঠ বা মেটাল দিয়ে তৈরি হয়, যা টেকসই এবং দীর্ঘস্থায়ী।</p></li><li data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1265\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\"><p data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1265\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\"><span data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1141\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">কমপ্যাক্ট এবং স্থান বাঁচানোর ডিজাইন</span>: এর ডিজাইন ছোট এবং স্নিগ্ধ, যা বাড়ির ছোট জায়গাতেও সহজে রাখা যায়। এটি খুব বেশি স্থান দখল না করে প্রয়োজনীয় সুবিধা প্রদান করে।</p></li><li data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1421\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\"><p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1421\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\"><span data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1290\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">প্রযুক্তি সহায়তা</span>: কিছু মডেলে প্যানেল বা বিশেষ ডিভাইস থাকে যাতে আপনার ট্যাবলেট, স্মার্টফোন বা ল্যাপটপ রাখা যায়, ফলে আপনি আরও বেশি সুবিধা পেতে পারেন।</p></li><li data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1562\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\"><p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1562\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\"><span data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1444\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">স্বাস্থ্যসম্মত</span>: এই টেবিলটি দীর্ঘ সময় বই পড়া বা কাজ করার সময় আপনার শারীরিক অবস্থান উন্নত করতে সাহায্য করে, যা স্বাস্থ্য রক্ষায় সহায়ক।</p></li></ol>', 'DS055', 'public/images/product/17790104173893Copy of Copy of 01619-406949.jpg', '[\"1760202451_Adjustable-Reading-Table-F9.jpg\",\"1760202451_FOLDABLE-HEIGHT-ADJUSTABLE-READING-TABLE6.jpg\",\"1760202451_FOLDABLE-HEIGHT-ADJUSTABLE-READING-TABLE3 - Copy.jpg\",\"1760202451_Adjustable-Reading-Table-F2.jpg\",\"1760202451_Adjustable-Reading-Table-F5.jpg\",\"1760202451_Adjustable-Reading-Table-F6.jpg\"]', 'public/images/product/17790104173893Copy of Copy of 01619-406949.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Active', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-10-11 17:32:40', '2026-05-17 09:33:37', 80, 130);
