o: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); outline-color: rgba(2, 8, 23, 0.5); margin: 0px 0px 0.5rem; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.6;\">✔ Ideal for home kitchen, restaurants, and shops</li></ul>', '1200', 'public/images/product/176898639018131764767810283_6-layer-round-shape-kitchen-Rack-3.webp', '[\"1768986390_1764767845868_6-layer-round-shape-kitchen-Rack-6.webp\",\"1768986390_1764767840571_6-layer-round-shape-kitchen-Rack-4.webp\",\"1768986390_1764767833960_6-layer-round-shape-kitchen-Rack-2.webp\",\"1768986390_1764767825502_6-layer-round-shape-kitchen-Rack-5.webp\"]', 'public/images/product/176898639018131764767810283_6-layer-round-shape-kitchen-Rack-3.webp', NULL, '6 Layer Kitchen Vegetable Rack – Heavy Duty Metal Storage Organizer | Fruits & Vegetable Stand with Wheels | Space Saving Kitchen Rack', '6 Layer Kitchen Vegetable Rack – Heavy Duty Metal Storage Organizer | Fruits & Vegetable Stand with Wheels | Space Saving Kitchen Rack', 'Upgrade your kitchen storage with this 6 Layer Kitchen Vegetable Rack, designed for modern homes that need both style and functionality. This premium-quality rack is made from heavy-duty metal, ensuring long-lasting durability even with daily use. Each basket features a perforated breathable design that keeps fruits and vegetables fresh for longer by allowing proper air circulation.\r\n\r\nWith its 6 spacious storage layers, you can easily organize potatoes, onions, fruits, sauces, jars, snacks, and more. The 360° smooth-rolling wheels let you move the rack effortlessly around the kitchen, dining area, or pantry.\r\n\r\nAvailable in Round Shape & Square Shape, this rack fits perfectly into small spaces and helps maximize kitchen organization. Ideal for homes, restaurants, mini-marts, and grocery stores.\r\n\r\nWhether you want a clean kitchen look or a practical storage solution, this 6 Layer Vegetable Rack is the perfect space-saving organizer.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n✅ Key Features\r\n✔ 6-layer large capacity for fruits, vegetables & groceries\r\n✔ Strong metal construction – rust-resistant & durable\r\n✔ Perforated basket design for proper ventilation\r\n✔ 360° rotating wheels for smooth movement\r\n✔ Space-saving modern design\r\n✔ Available in Round and Square shapes\r\n✔ Ideal for home kitchen, restaurants, and shops', 'Active', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, 0, 1, '2026-01-21 09:02:15', '2026-01-21 09:06:30', NULL, NULL);
